WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.680
The AI supply chain includes the components, services, data, and processes that make an AI system work.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:18.900
This may include models, datasets, embeddings, vector databases, packages, containers, APIs, plugins, prompts, tools, cloud services, and deployment pipelines.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:22.560
AI applications are rarely built from one isolated model.

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:30.780
They are assembled from many moving parts that may come from internal teams, open-source projects, commercial providers, and third-party services.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.640
If teams do not understand those parts, they cannot effectively manage risk.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:40.020
Visibility is the foundation for responsible AI engineering.
